---
layout: default
---
{%- comment -%}
  Section-based page layout (local override of al_folio_core's about layout).
  The page's `sections:` front matter is an ordered list; each entry is rendered by
  _includes/gd/section.liquid -> _includes/gd/sections/<type>.liquid.
  Reorder, remove or add sections by editing that list. See docs/EDITING.md.
{%- endcomment -%}
<div class="post gd-home">
  <article>
    {%- for section in page.sections %}
      {% include gd/section.liquid section=section body=content %}
    {%- endfor %}
  </article>
</div>
